msgstr "Копиране с метаданни"

#: includes-core/TaxopressCoreAdmin.php:392
msgid "Auto Terms using AI Connectors"
msgstr "Автоматични условия с помощта на AI Connectors"

#: includes-core/TaxopressCoreAdmin.php:397
msgid ""
"PublishPress Taxonomies Pro can generate terms using any compatible AI "
"provider configured in Settings > Connectors."
